# Research evidence integrity.
#
# Experiment result CSVs are written by Python's csv module, which emits
# RFC 4180 CRLF terminators. Their exact bytes are recorded in the
# prior_evidence_baseline.sha256 manifests under v2/results/. Disabling
# line-ending conversion keeps a clone byte-identical to the committed
# evidence on every platform, so those checksums continue to verify.
*.csv -text
